# =============================================================================
# Written next to upstream's electron-builder.yml rather than over it, so the
# submodule stays clean (CLAUDE.md §2.6). Differences from upstream, each for a
# reason:
#
#   appId / productName   ours, from client.env. CLAUDE.md §8a: where we differ
#                         from EternalRO is content and identity, and the window
#                         title is the cheapest piece of that.
#
#   files:                upstream ships only lodash-es and bson out of
#                         node_modules. rijndael-js and granny-ro-js are also
#                         reachable by static import from the startup graph, so
#                         a packaged build without them never reaches the login
#                         window. See index.html.template for the trace.
#
#   asar: false           kept. The generated index.html stays a readable file
